qwen-asr-cpp
============

A C++ inference library for Qwen3-ASR (Alibaba Cloud / Qwen Team)
on-device automatic speech recognition.

v0.1 wraps the antirez/qwen-asr pure-C inference engine
(vendored under vendor/qwen-asr-c/) behind a C++ API. v0.2 (planned)
ports the inference path onto GGML for multi-backend GPU support.

