Build-time dependencies (not redistributed)
-------------------------------------------

* Apple Accelerate framework (closed-source, ships with macOS / iOS).
  Linked dynamically when QWEN_USE_BLAS=ON on Apple platforms.

* OpenBLAS (BSD-3-Clause). Linked dynamically when QWEN_USE_BLAS=ON
  on Linux and BLAS_FOUND.

* GGML (MIT, https://github.com/ggerganov/ggml). NOT linked in v0.1;
  scheduled for v0.2 alongside the GPU backend port.
